# Anthropic (Claude API). Published IP addresses, ingress (the addresses a
# client talks TO):
#   https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/ip-addresses
# Verified 2026-10-23: dig api.anthropic.com -> 160.79.104.10 (inside /23).
#
# Anthropic's *outbound* range (160.79.104.0/21) is deliberately NOT listed:
# those are the addresses Anthropic connects FROM (MCP tool calls, webhooks),
# not the ones its API is served from, and a /21 would swallow the ingress /23.
#
# Load with: --protocols-list-dir <dir containing this file>
# See lists/protocols/README.md for what a by-IP entry does (and does not) say.
